WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.157
Unit twenty-five. My Healthy Day!

2
00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:07.953
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.003 --> 00:00:11.801
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.851 --> 00:00:15.826
Today we learn about My Healthy Day. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.915 --> 00:00:20.432
Wake up. Say it with me. Wake up!

6
00:00:23.915 --> 00:00:27.715
Breakfast. Say it with me. Breakfast!

7
00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:34.767
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

8
00:00:38.269 --> 00:00:41.569
Brush. Say it with me. Brush!

9
00:00:45.063 --> 00:00:48.396
Play. Say it with me. Play!

10
00:00:51.896 --> 00:00:55.263
Learn. Say it with me. Learn!

11
00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:02.396
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

12
00:01:05.897 --> 00:01:09.397
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

13
00:01:12.902 --> 00:01:20.761
On a healthy day, I wake up, wash, brush my teeth, and eat breakfast. I learn and play at school. At night I go to sleep early.

14
00:01:20.811 --> 00:01:22.036
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.266 --> 00:01:28.356
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.406 --> 00:01:29.556
Wash!

17
00:01:30.398 --> 00:01:35.627
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.677 --> 00:01:36.828
Sleep!

19
00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:43.508
Did you know? Doing healthy things at the same time every day helps them become habits!

20
00:01:43.558 --> 00:01:45.484
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.177 --> 00:01:53.805
Think and answer. What healthy things do you do every day?

22
00:01:53.855 --> 00:01:55.005
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.137 --> 00:02:04.422
Wonderful work, everyone! You finished Health Grade 1. Keep your healthy habits, and see you in Grade 2. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.472 --> 00:02:07.553
Thank you, Nurse Bopha! See you in Grade 2!

